"app.name" = "Noty";
"app.about.title" = "About Noty";
"app.about.message" = "Sticky notes docked to the edge of your screen.\n\n⌥⌘N  new note      ⌥⌘A  all notes      ⌥⌘L  archive\nIn a note — Esc closes, ⌘F finds, ⌘. cycles colour, ⌘⌫ deletes.\n\nNotes are stored locally in an SQLite database; bodies are encrypted with AES-GCM. Your notes never leave this Mac — the only network request the app makes is the update check, which you can switch off.";

